<body>
    <h1>Device Service</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 local-id=3D"10dd7976-2d5e-4c2e-a61f-de6e8f789c32" id=3D"DeviceS=
ervice-1.Overview">1. Overview</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3f21fe9f-bffa-4e3e-ac39-b79f8bd58a7b">The device-service man=
ages all device-centric data and operations, including device registration,=
 updates, deletion, device-user and device-organization mappings, device me=
tadata, and device file references. Authentication and roles are handled by=
 dedicated services.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d5a65b62-e7f4-49ae-accd-adf2ba5d480b"></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"6b90c802-4920-4909-8d68-52d7bf1a494e" id=3D"DeviceService-2=
.DeviceFlows">2. Device Flows</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"7bbf12df-949f-4cb8-94cf-6764eb89f720" id=3D"DeviceService-a=
.DeviceLifecycle">a. Device Lifecycle</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"fa5b3779-6701-437e-ba6f-2d8d5b8f15b7">
<li local-id=3D"32924973-452e-4219-b0b2-c117d9245b80">
<p local-id=3D"03185ba1-5717-4634-a415-0fbbf66714d0"><strong>Register Devic=
e</strong>: Register a new device via API.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0fe38218-8d7b-4d28-9a72-30438e320949">
<p local-id=3D"c766426a-dcfa-4224-b0b8-37d72167d65a"><strong>Get Device</st=
rong>: Retrieve device details by deviceId.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e320acd-8b43-41c5-a9ba-653d2384171f">
<p local-id=3D"f9af11df-222f-4f5d-823a-144414df72f5"><strong>Update Device<=
/strong>: Update device profile, status, or metadata.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ddfae30d-3e45-47da-8710-e14d8456f44b">
<p local-id=3D"4e72bcbb-f434-4dab-ab4f-5d6633cfbadb"><strong>Delete Device<=
/strong>: Remove a device (soft or hard delete).</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"1e8c6e9d-f00d-410b-96e4-9fb2d6b15c7a" id=3D"DeviceService-b=
.Device-UserMapping">b. Device-User Mapping</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"ca85d540-25bd-4be2-9869-f56ad5a1f4bb">
<li local-id=3D"e573a8a7-83aa-4a1d-a5f7-138e90d516c6">
<p local-id=3D"2300c065-dd52-4847-a937-e1d6637f2e91"><strong>Assign Device =
to User</strong>: Map a device to a user.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a044d383-f2af-42bb-9925-9c1ccc6b573b">
<p local-id=3D"f391f6ec-347e-4172-9af1-d42e8a5eaf15"><strong>Remove Device =
from User</strong>: Unmap a device from a user.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e0bfad9d-09f2-4ac0-876c-3cd1319b2249">
<p local-id=3D"e166af8f-b558-48ed-829a-71bbed78459b"><strong>List Device Us=
ers</strong>: List all users assigned to a device.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"616b12dd-9ea3-43d2-954a-413cc3167caa" id=3D"DeviceService-c=
.Device-OrganizationMapping">c. Device-Organization Mapping</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"4e3d9798-f6b5-460f-8474-f0a5d776c6b8">
<li local-id=3D"4f2250f7-c678-4f08-bbbb-99c1c021e502">
<p local-id=3D"496d4d04-5b57-4f3d-aa86-bceeb97ad05a"><strong>Assign Device =
to Organization</strong>: Map a device to an organization.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d27bfbf8-ec87-4ed3-b3aa-2f609497b41c">
<p local-id=3D"8119f803-96ca-4ae9-a780-3d0e1dca4df1"><strong>Remove Device =
from Organization</strong>: Unmap a device from an organization.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f5409623-7469-4acf-bd0d-7ea1b67484f6">
<p local-id=3D"c731c8f8-e6c9-4e8d-aefe-532e5341a532"><strong>List Device Or=
ganizations</strong>: List all organizations a device is assigned to.</p></=
li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"7a432391-d214-4caf-a0ce-9844c89721c3" id=3D"DeviceService-d=
.DeviceMetadata&amp;Files">d. Device Metadata &amp; Files</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"57549f42-e755-4898-8131-5ba2a6d91548">
<li local-id=3D"c261f6db-300d-496a-9c41-f86fa07b2815">
<p local-id=3D"1808dfbf-3548-4e47-b88e-92e9f9a78fda"><strong>Update Metadat=
a</strong>: Store or update custom device metadata.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"336b3cd0-e6a4-4c5c-8239-115d86ab6346">
<p local-id=3D"ee93e97f-b1fd-4675-98fb-c3a966ccef5a"><strong>Upload File</s=
trong>: Device uploads file to S3, Lambda updates device record with file r=
eference.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e41642a7-b04f-40a2-b313-5c5681d9c517">
<p local-id=3D"49638c25-cd8e-434b-a25d-0c9258edf7cc"><strong>List Files</st=
rong>: List all files associated with a device.</p></li>
</ul>
<h4 local-id=3D"8a3c5385-37fd-404c-8e10-16f159d6a93a" id=3D"DeviceService-e=
.Event-DrivenFlows">e. Event-Driven Flows</h4>
<ul local-id=3D"264f263d-790e-41de-8cb4-33d9988ada65">
<li local-id=3D"6d6a7315-4739-4c42-a244-9c397e38511b">
<p local-id=3D"9b922095-ee81-409f-b5a7-0204a11c9ef9"><strong>Device Change =
Events</strong>: DynamoDB Streams trigger audit, analytics, or notification=
 Lambdas.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"45ef216f-34e1-4b86-9989-34dc74aa710d">
<p local-id=3D"a3c2cbf6-705c-4999-a5f3-deb9edc00300"><strong>Device Reminde=
rs/Notifications</strong>: SQS triggers for device reminders.</p></li>
</ul><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper c=
onfluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image ima=
ge-center" alt=3D"image-20251217-110243.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy"=
 src=3D"f0329592ce9b73470098f77ec51141f40c91084de6e92bf87b72602346464306" d=
ata-image-src=3D"https://firminiq.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/3=
44621063/image-20251217-110243.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D17659=
69366025&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"659" data-width=
=3D"496" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"344=
752130" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"att=
achment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20251217-110243.png" d=
ata-base-url=3D"https://firminiq.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-c=
ontent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"344621063" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"1" data-media-id=3D"39c01741-72f5-=
4ca3-b523-9d96a52a5814" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"622"></span>
<ul local-id=3D"7783da50-6a85-44de-840b-b1f3cb9affea">
<li local-id=3D"08b171bf-424f-4563-bbfc-cf8d02c4ab89">
<p local-id=3D"85b561cb-7dcb-402f-ac0d-ea1057e9b1e4"><strong>API Gateway</s=
trong>: Entry point for all device-service APIs.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a5fedcbb-7a2c-4561-b8b3-b203979a9d13">
<p local-id=3D"e5e7ab18-fccc-497b-82c2-c6c0d2e1df84"><strong>Device-Service=
 Lambdas</strong>: Handle business logic for CRUD, mapping, metadata, and f=
ile reference.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"998b2d89-85ec-4514-b73c-cf8bed5e941a">
<p local-id=3D"f99b4432-a32d-42de-912f-70ab9e85f1a3"><strong>DynamoDB Devic=
eTable</strong>: Stores all device data.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"185edf82-043a-4a9a-9c42-02d1993fb5e4">
<p local-id=3D"07fbff3a-11f9-45cd-a89f-440056ed3eb1"><strong>DynamoDB Strea=
ms</strong>: Triggers for audit, analytics, and notifications.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"46ad720d-4925-4915-8af9-79d89b3fadd2">
<p local-id=3D"b67da1df-88fa-4a64-a173-b9683a5cb120"><strong>S3</strong>: F=
or device file uploads (e.g., logs, images).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"82cd7370-6cf5-4adf-bf04-f778eea0a5a4">
<p local-id=3D"dc1aacfb-36e5-4410-a44b-6fd235c27388"><strong>SQS</strong>: =
For async device-related workflows (e.g., reminders, notifications).</p></l=
i>
</ul>
